                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d6dd5b58-d0cd-3907-bce3-21921ea8fd1f",
                        "entry_id": "b5b1e076-7722-30cd-ab55-8a54542c18b6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "ботан. род многолетних кустарниковых или полукустарниковых растений семейства ладанниковых (Cistaceae)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a2db2a30-379a-41fd-b0bb-e2f1aa4276ab",
                                "sense_id": "d6dd5b58-d0cd-3907-bce3-21921ea8fd1f",
                                "text": "Парфюмеры используют природное душистое сырье в огромном ассортименте — в их распоряжении около пяти тысяч названий. ❬…❭ Это роза, кориандр, тмин, мускатный шалфей, герань, мята, лаванда, анис, жасмин, дубовый мох, азалия, ладанник и другие."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0e2b536f-f4d9-431c-a4ef-84d8b2b01928",
                        "source_entry_id": "b5b1e076-7722-30cd-ab55-8a54542c18b6",
                        "source_sense_id": "d6dd5b58-d0cd-3907-bce3-21921ea8fd1f",
                        "target_lang_word": "cistus",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cistus",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8266088b-98ac-3347-b840-d63f24fabaeb",
                                        "entry_id": "547e348c-cbe3-3175-980a-21b3ee8f6dca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A rockrose; a plant of the genus Cistus."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2eae788-4ede-4437-b729-3d383bc8bcfd",
                                                "sense_id": "8266088b-98ac-3347-b840-d63f24fabaeb",
                                                "text": "Everywhere in spring the ground is carpeted with a profusion of wild-flowers, cistus and brown orchis, narcissus and the scarlet anemone; sometimes the forest scenery sweeps away, and leaves us among olive-grounds and orange-gardens arranged in formal, picturesque rows."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4ea565f-4d9f-4dc7-a30a-1898a9504e86",
                                                "sense_id": "8266088b-98ac-3347-b840-d63f24fabaeb",
                                                "text": "drawing his huge ungainly form from the soft cushion of moss, where the daisies and golden cistus flowers had shut their eyes for the night"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62cd638a-2f74-4c76-9543-405e06effa6c",
                                                "sense_id": "8266088b-98ac-3347-b840-d63f24fabaeb",
                                                "text": "There is as yet no evening-primrose to open suddenly, no cistus to drop its petals; but the May-flower knows the hour, and becomes more fragrant in the darkness, so that one can then often find it in the woods without aid from the eye."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2fe49ca3-bad6-4d06-ac85-233277280b10",
                                                "sense_id": "8266088b-98ac-3347-b840-d63f24fabaeb",
                                                "text": "If the court had its clustering noisettes, and fraxinellas, and sweetbriar, and great tall white lilies, the moorland had its little creeping scented rose, its straggling honeysuckle, and an abundance of yellow cistus; and here and there a gray rock cropped out of the ground, and over it the yellow stone-crop and scarlet-leaved crane's-bill grew luxuriantly."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2d8a792c-6ba8-4320-9d24-c06bef72cd5a",
                        "source_entry_id": "b5b1e076-7722-30cd-ab55-8a54542c18b6",
                        "source_sense_id": "d6dd5b58-d0cd-3907-bce3-21921ea8fd1f",
                        "target_lang_word": "ciste",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ciste",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f531b9ff-cfd9-3d32-82d1-ddf060a14698",
                                        "entry_id": "527570b4-668b-394b-93fc-be1e074190b0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Arbrisseau poussant le plus souvent sur le pourtour méditerranéen, à feuilles persistantes simples, souvent velues, aux fleurs à cinq pétales, souvent plissés roses ou blancs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9a4f582-17f1-4d59-903c-68d4aeec48c3",
                                                "sense_id": "f531b9ff-cfd9-3d32-82d1-ddf060a14698",
                                                "text": "Une espèce de ciste, le ciste de Crète, donne une sorte de gomme odorante nommée ladanum qui était en usage en médecine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17e78bd8-a7db-44dc-86a7-2f2ff6002306",
                                                "sense_id": "f531b9ff-cfd9-3d32-82d1-ddf060a14698",
                                                "text": "Les cistes sont, comme nous l’avons indiqué, des plantes méditerranéennes; elles sont spéciales aux pentes qui inclinent vers notre mer intérieure."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "ciste",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f7e792ba-57bf-30f9-82b0-883ab96ab8c1",
                                        "entry_id": "943e9ca6-0f7a-335c-8b1e-589bdc932927",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sépulture individuelle ou double, multiples ou collectives, de petites dimensions, utilisée depuis la Préhistoire jusqu'au haut Moyen Âge, se présentant sous la forme d'un caisson ou coffre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Funéraire"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7be76e9-f28b-4136-a937-0a537ad6af5b",
                                                "sense_id": "f7e792ba-57bf-30f9-82b0-883ab96ab8c1",
                                                "text": "Cette cavité, coudée à l’équerre, communiquait à travers la dalle sous-jacente avec les restes humains déposés dans la ciste funéraire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93074c77-e81e-40ee-82be-980f9688a97d",
                                                "sense_id": "f7e792ba-57bf-30f9-82b0-883ab96ab8c1",
                                                "text": "Elles laissent voir une certaine hétérogénéité des rituels eux-mêmes, combinant (en contexte chasséen par exemple) sépultures individuelles fosses ou cistes, lieux isolés ou petits ensembles funéraires liés à l’habitat, ou même grottes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
